            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The multioutput process "biogas, agriculture covered, in cogen with biogas engine" delivers the co-products: heat "heat, at cogen with biogas engine, agricultural covered, allocation exergy" and electricity "electricity, at cogen with biogas engine, agricultural covered, alloc. Exergy". The allocation is based on the exergy values of heat and electricity. The exergy value of electricity is 1, and the exergy value of heat is 0.17.  The degrees of efficiency are as follows: electricity: 33% and heat: 67%, but in these plants only half of the heat is used or sold (32%). ;
UUID: f750cb25-3801-38c0-a8e1-454eec70b8f5</common:generalComment>
